  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 3 Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - It is time to use what you have made so far and create the ENCODER!
  - First use the POSITIONAL EMBEDDER to get the starting embedding from the resource
    TOKENS.
  - Then feed the EMBEDDING into the ATTENTION mechanism that you have created.
  - However, keep a copy of the original embedding around and add it back into the
    result of the ATTENTION mechanism. This is called a residual connection and helps
    with retaining previous information.
  - Normalize the result to keep the values from exploding into huge numbers before
    you continue. Then pass the result into a NEURAL NETWORK.
  - Be sure to also add a residual connection here!
  - After normalizing the output, you have officially built your first ENCODER!
